# {{APP_NAME_ZH}}（{{APP_NAME_EN}}）

**每一次修图操作都是一条数据：可导出、可回放、可逐像素复现。**

**{{AUTHOR}}**（{{AUTHOR_EMAIL}}）· {{UNIVERSITY_EN}} · {{UNIVERSITY_KO}}
代码 MIT · 文档与教学素材 CC BY 4.0

一个打开就能用的网页图像编辑器（图层、画笔、油漆桶、渐变、形状、文字、选区、逐像素调整、撤销重做），和普通编辑器的区别只有一点：**你的每一次操作都被记成一行 JSON**。把这段日志交给同一个执行器从头回放，画布能逐像素还原——所以这段日志就是一份现成的“人是怎么一步步修图的”训练数据。页面会自动播放一段程序画出来的示例日志，把每一步显示成 JSON 和 token，再把坐标和颜色量化成四个档位回放、算 PSNR，并用公式、颜色矩阵或卷积核解释每一次调整。电脑和手机都能用，不需要安装、不需要联网。

**English summary.** *{{APP_NAME_EN}}* is a browser-only teaching demo: a small image editor in which every edit is recorded as one JSON line, so replaying the log through the same executor reproduces the canvas pixel for pixel and the log doubles as a behaviour-cloning dataset. The page auto-plays a procedurally drawn demo log, shows each operation as JSON and as tokens, replays the log with quantised coordinates and colours at four presets and reports PSNR, and explains every per-pixel adjustment with its formula, colour matrix or convolution kernel. Works on desktop and on phones (portrait layout, pointer / touch drawing), from GitHub Pages or from `file://` after a double-click. UI and documentation are in Chinese.

